{"2025.11.21版:P12-Q12":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>阴离子面心堆积晶胞</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2025.11.21版 · 雅礼2025届二模 · 原题12 · P12-Q12</div><h1>阴离子面心堆积晶胞</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/晶体常识</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：由投影判断阳离子位置和密度。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/物质的量/物质的量及单位——摩尔</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/晶体结构与性质/常见几种晶体类型</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：O~16  F~19  Na~23  Al~27  K~39  Ce~140</p><p>12. 已知某晶体的晶胞中阴离子做面心立方堆积，阴离子的位置(隐去阳离子)如图1所示，其晶胞中的阳离子在xy、xz、yz平面的投影(隐去阴离子)均如图2所示，晶胞参数为apm。下列说法正确的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:3e7d638b8195106be76facaaa9603f07b5d94c7d7a36690f93b6930eb065bb5b:0;\" style=\"width:469.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. <img src=\"chem-asset:aa4ce4ca369de9a9a7159ca5d340b4345d42815d5a233255e135fdd03c7901d1:1;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的配位数(紧邻的氟离子数)为48</p><p>B. 化学式为<img src=\"chem-asset:3067581cc4da17112da396d39ab990222e0c3c20b4d17b53a72f894f300c6ebb:2;\" style=\"width:76.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. 晶胞中所有<img src=\"chem-asset:aa4ce4ca369de9a9a7159ca5d340b4345d42815d5a233255e135fdd03c7901d1:1;\" style=\"width:22.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">围成的形状是正方形</p><p>D. 晶体密度为<img src=\"chem-asset:ee2474deafb9ae6613ee2b2a2350255c31b519693657f0d4204db07c71aae86d:3;\" style=\"width:120.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．K<sup>+</sup>处于顶点和面心<img src=\"chem-asset:abb81be9e0544f2967a48e8bbee48202af9e022e5055e3cf3bb54da4ea9d8af3:4;\" style=\"width:37.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"> 构成的正四面体中，结合<img src=\"chem-asset:abb81be9e0544f2967a48e8bbee48202af9e022e5055e3cf3bb54da4ea9d8af3:4;\" style=\"width:37.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">空间结构可知，每个<img src=\"chem-asset:abb81be9e0544f2967a48e8bbee48202af9e022e5055e3cf3bb54da4ea9d8af3:4;\" style=\"width:37.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中的3个F原子距离K<sup>+</sup>最近，则每个K<sup>+</sup>的配位数为12，故A错误；</p><p>B．据“均摊法”，晶胞中含8×<img src=\"chem-asset:b659799658a00c80dbd62cb84a59314f8f08596d1c71976d9cc26d1aafb2d74c:5;\" style=\"width:15.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">+6×<img src=\"chem-asset:c2a699cc66e5de200508ee86c9c0f03a91a2d2ba22741dc63d78003de5c13307:6;\" style=\"width:14.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=4个<img src=\"chem-asset:abb81be9e0544f2967a48e8bbee48202af9e022e5055e3cf3bb54da4ea9d8af3:4;\" style=\"width:37.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则晶胞中钾离子、钠离子共有12个，结合图2可知，钠离子处于棱心和体心、钾离子处于晶胞平分8个小立方体的体心，则晶胞中含+12×<img src=\"chem-asset:ad57736181ba4d37373de22b8cd91005b4d47b959250da53475a2c8c8d6777ee:7;\" style=\"width:15.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=4个Na<sup>+</sup>、8个K<sup>+</sup>，其化学式为K<sub>2</sub>NaAlF<sub>6</sub>，故B错误；</p><p>C．K<sup>+</sup>在晶胞中的位置为（<img src=\"chem-asset:ad57736181ba4d37373de22b8cd91005b4d47b959250da53475a2c8c8d6777ee:7;\" style=\"width:15.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">,<img src=\"chem-asset:ad57736181ba4d37373de22b8cd91005b4d47b959250da53475a2c8c8d6777ee:7;\" style=\"width:15.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">,<img src=\"chem-asset:ad57736181ba4d37373de22b8cd91005b4d47b959250da53475a2c8c8d6777ee:7;\" style=\"width:15.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">）等8个四面体空隙（坐标分量为<img src=\"chem-asset:ad57736181ba4d37373de22b8cd91005b4d47b959250da53475a2c8c8d6777ee:7;\" style=\"width:15.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">或<img src=\"chem-asset:3672b12e2bac44353353b96300a57965e8d09df29898da3815cbc249ff8ecd7f:8;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">），这些点围成的形状是立方体而非正方形，故C错误；</p><p>D．晶胞中离子总质量为968 g/mol（由密度公式推导，968=39×8+23×4+27×4+19×24），晶胞体积为(a×10<sup>-10</sup> cm)<sup>3</sup>=a<sup>3</sup>×10<sup>-30</sup> cm³，密度<img src=\"chem-asset:9f8d9a1a5875d34fd9863b3fd302b773dd48630e59468d8c2188613a6c200bfb:9;\" style=\"width:460.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=<img src=\"chem-asset:ee2474deafb9ae6613ee2b2a2350255c31b519693657f0d4204db07c71aae86d:3;\" style=\"width:120.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故D正确；</p><p>故选D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2025.11.21版\\精品解析：湖南省长沙市雅礼中学2025届高三下学期二模化学试题\\精品解析：湖南省长沙市雅礼中学2025届高三下学期二模化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2025.11.21%E7%89%88/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%81%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E4%BA%8C%E6%A8%A1%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E7%9C%81%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E4%BA%8C%E6%A8%A1%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["3067581cc4da17112da396d39ab990222e0c3c20b4d17b53a72f894f300c6ebb","3672b12e2bac44353353b96300a57965e8d09df29898da3815cbc249ff8ecd7f","3e7d638b8195106be76facaaa9603f07b5d94c7d7a36690f93b6930eb065bb5b","9f8d9a1a5875d34fd9863b3fd302b773dd48630e59468d8c2188613a6c200bfb","aa4ce4ca369de9a9a7159ca5d340b4345d42815d5a233255e135fdd03c7901d1","abb81be9e0544f2967a48e8bbee48202af9e022e5055e3cf3bb54da4ea9d8af3","ad57736181ba4d37373de22b8cd91005b4d47b959250da53475a2c8c8d6777ee","b659799658a00c80dbd62cb84a59314f8f08596d1c71976d9cc26d1aafb2d74c","c2a699cc66e5de200508ee86c9c0f03a91a2d2ba22741dc63d78003de5c13307","ee2474deafb9ae6613ee2b2a2350255c31b519693657f0d4204db07c71aae86d"],"sourceSha256":"4dfdf9afbc905862d96aaa02a425620d5aeb3ada4bce483f657d13dc64e4e13d"},"2025.11.21版:P15-Q03":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>食盐侯氏制碱与滴定装置</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2025.11.21版 · 华中师大一附中2025年高考考前测试卷 · 原题3 · P15-Q03</div><h1>食盐侯氏制碱与滴定装置</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学实验基础/探究性实验/化学实验方案的设计与评价</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：判断装置和操作目的。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/酸碱中和滴定</span><span class=\"tag\">化学实验基础/常见物质的制备/常见无机物的制备</span><span class=\"tag\">化学实验基础/仪器使用与实验安全</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p><img src=\"chem-asset:13e4441ee74aa28054deb3b65b2e0e9257f82c54710933e1907d0b948663f190:0;\" style=\"width:950.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:405462625cc19bf40b84040d78ad4af8adc877010c5cea130a47c0b119e1b2ef:1;\" style=\"width:950.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:29dd5c548c17d0d11900eec8629d622dc18c63da857cf9b41cd224dcdd92504d:2;\" style=\"width:950.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>本批原答案：D</p><figure><img src=\"chem-asset:e48a2682c93816e43adc2bf238fc10a1c82bd8bd418233b69795c3f8ae6cd0cd:3;\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;margin:0\" alt=\"原答案与解析PDF第1页对应题目\"></figure></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>原答案与解析合并保存在上方原图中。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2025.11.21版\\湖北省武汉市华中师范大学第一附属中学2025届高三下学期高考考前测试 化学试题\\华中师大一附中2025年高考考前测试化学\\化学(1).pdf</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2025.11.21%E7%89%88/%E6%B9%96%E5%8C%97%E7%9C%81%E6%AD%A6%E6%B1%89%E5%B8%82%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%B8%88%E8%8C%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E9%99%84%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E8%80%83%E5%89%8D%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%B8%88%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E9%99%84%E4%B8%AD2025%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E8%80%83%E5%89%8D%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%281%29.pdf\">打开原来源文件</a><p>对应原答案与解析PDF：<a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2025.11.21%E7%89%88/%E6%B9%96%E5%8C%97%E7%9C%81%E6%AD%A6%E6%B1%89%E5%B8%82%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%B8%88%E8%8C%83%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E9%99%84%E5%B1%9E%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E8%80%83%E5%89%8D%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%AD%E5%B8%88%E5%A4%A7%E4%B8%80%E9%99%84%E4%B8%AD2025%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E8%80%83%E8%80%83%E5%89%8D%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88.pdf\">D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2025.11.21版\\湖北省武汉市华中师范大学第一附属中学2025届高三下学期高考考前测试 化学试题\\华中师大一附中2025年高考考前测试化学\\化学答案.pdf</a></p></details></main></body></html>","assets":["13e4441ee74aa28054deb3b65b2e0e9257f82c54710933e1907d0b948663f190","29dd5c548c17d0d11900eec8629d622dc18c63da857cf9b41cd224dcdd92504d","405462625cc19bf40b84040d78ad4af8adc877010c5cea130a47c0b119e1b2ef","e48a2682c93816e43adc2bf238fc10a1c82bd8bd418233b69795c3f8ae6cd0cd"],"sourceSha256":"ecc481d15064df21e5b35b3d5158c9c9d62de9cd517554d62d4a5e3b3e3ba547"}}